{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>ANGST</strong> is a quest-driven survival game in a frozen, mysterious limbo world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949910/extras/a66789607531afdf294ac7afa19ab9eb.poster.avif?t=1757575136\" width=616 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949910/extras/a66789607531afdf294ac7afa19ab9eb.webm?t=1757575136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949910/extras/a66789607531afdf294ac7afa19ab9eb.mp4?t=1757575136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You awaken alone in a vast, frozen wilderness where survival is the main goal. Hunt, gather, and craft to endure the cold by day, then face deadly creatures and strange entities that emerge at night. Some may guide you, others will hunt you. Trust nothing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949910/extras/b75b503b179764a114f1746881753c3a.poster.avif?t=1757575136\" width=616 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949910/extras/b75b503b179764a114f1746881753c3a.webm?t=1757575136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Uncover the mysteries of the Hollow as you complete quests that reveal its forgotten past and your place within it. Each choice shapes your fate, each death teaches a lesson, and every step deeper into the wild brings greater danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949910/extras/8701509739a31857a687cca8fc8cc0e8.poster.avif?t=1757575136\" width=616 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949910/extras/8701509739a31857a687cca8fc8cc0e8.webm?t=1757575136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore forests, frozen rivers, and desolate plains filled with unique challenges. Scavenge cabins, fish in icy waters, and cut wood to survive the cold, but beware: the deeper you venture, the deadlier it becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the frozen wilderness</strong>: Hunt, gather, and craft to withstand the cold by day, then face deadly creatures and strange entities at night.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trust nothing</strong>: Some beings may guide you, others will hunt you. Help and harm both wait in the shadows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the Hollow\u2019s mysteries</strong>: Complete quests that reveal the land\u2019s forgotten past and your place within it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices matter</strong>: Every decision shapes your survival, and each death unlocks new skills and lessons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adapt to escalating threats</strong>: Upgrade your character, evolve your abilities, and build a strategy that fits your play style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge and endure</strong>: Search abandoned cabins, fish in icy waters, and cut wood to survive the cold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tense, dynamic survival</strong>: Every sound could signal danger, and the deeper you venture, the deadlier it becomes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949910/extras/00f6d504878765856442e44753f3a23f.poster.avif?t=1757575136\" width=616 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949910/extras/00f6d504878765856442e44753f3a23f.webm?t=1757575136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949910/extras/00f6d504878765856442e44753f3a23f.mp4?t=1757575136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2949910?t=1757575136","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949910/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757575136","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949910/f2410e99c24cb2d66e0b6847b7eb921e47d9937e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757575136","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949910/f2410e99c24cb2d66e0b6847b7eb921e47d9937e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757575136","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>ANGST</strong> is a quest-driven survival game in a frozen, mysterious limbo world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" auto